      {
        "key": "packaging_rules",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The following provides the packaging rules for this qualification, followed by the list of relevant units of competency.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 1,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-1",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Total number of units = 20",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 2,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-2",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "15 core unitsplus",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 3,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-3",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "5 elective units, of which:",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 4,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-4",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "at least one (1) must be chosen from Group A",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 5,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-5",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "at least two (2) must be chosen from Group B",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 6,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-6",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than two (2) may be chosen from Group C",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 7,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-7",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than one (1) may be chosen from elsewhere within this training package, or from another endorsed training package, or from an accredited course.",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 8,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-8",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "OR",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 9,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-9",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-8"
          },
          {
            "text": "at least two (2) must be chosen from Group A",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 10,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-10",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "a further three (3) may be chosen from Group A, B, or C",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 11,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-11",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than one (1) may be chosen from elsewhere within this training package, or from another endorsed training package, or from an accredited course.",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 12,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-12",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-1"
          },
          {
            "text": "All elective units selected from outside this qualification must reflect current occupational and learning outcomes of this AQF qualification level.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 13,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-13",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There are both licensed and non-licensed units of competency relating to high risk work in the RII Resources and Infrastructure Industry Training Package. To be appointed under any statutory requirements in related roles, units of competency should be selected to meet the state/territory licensing requirements.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 14,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-14",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There is a prerequisite to an imported unit listed in this qualification. Where a unit is imported as an elective care must be taken to ensure that the prerequisite specified is complied with.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 15,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-15",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "*Note the following prerequisite unit requirements.",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 17,
            "indent": 1,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-17",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-12"
          }
        ],
        "order": 3,
        "table": {
          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                [
                  {
